chezmoi dots live — Internal live preview pane

USAGE
  chezmoi dots live [options]

ARGUMENTS
  Internal command started by the edit preview pane. No positional arguments are required; extras are ignored.
  Default: refresh the preview every 500ms.

OPTIONS
  -h, --help  Show this help and exit successfully.
  --bin <executable>  chezmoi executable (default: "chezmoi")
  --dir <directory>  working directory (default: "")
  --edited <file>  edited file (default: "")
  --file <file>  source file (default: "")
  --global <argument>  repeatable chezmoi global argument (default: "")
  --real-src <directory>  real source directory (default: "")
  --src <directory>  shadow source directory (default: "")

ENVIRONMENT
  None; pane configuration is passed through options.

EXAMPLES
  chezmoi dots help live
